Relevant columns and their possible use  
• TCGA.TCGA_VERSIONED.MASKED_SOMATIC_MUTATION_HG38_GDC_R39  
  – "project_short_name": restrict to bladder cancer (TCGA‑BLCA).  
  – "Hugo_Symbol": find CDKN2A mutations.  
  – "Variant_Type", "Variant_Classification": mutation type details.  
  – "case_barcode", "sample_barcode_tumor": IDs to link with clinical & expression tables.  

• TCGA.TCGA_VERSIONED.CLINICAL_GDC_R39  
  – "submitter_id": TCGA case barcode (join key).  
  – "demo__gender": patient gender.  
  – "demo__vital_status": vital status.  
  – "demo__days_to_death": time to death.  

• TCGA.TCGA_VERSIONED.RNASEQ_HG38_GDC_R39  
  – "case_barcode": join key.  
  – "gene_name": target genes (MDM2, TP53, CDKN1A, CCNE1).  
  – "HTSeq__FPKM" (or "HTSeq__Counts" / "HTSeq__FPKM_UQ"): gene‑expression values.  

Conditions that may be used  
• "project_short_name" = 'TCGA-BLCA'  
• "Hugo_Symbol" ILIKE '%CDKN2A%'  
• "gene_name" ILIKE '%MDM2%' (or TP53, CDKN1A, CCNE1)  

Below are ten exploratory Snowflake SQL queries (each limited to 20 rows) that progress from simple inspection to multi‑table joins leading toward the final answer.  
Every identifier is wrapped in double quotes.

```sql
-- 1. Description: show how CDKN2A is recorded in the masked mutation table and verify BLCA entries
SELECT DISTINCT 
       "Hugo_Symbol"
FROM   "TCGA"."TCGA_VERSIONED"."MASKED_SOMATIC_MUTATION_HG38_GDC_R39"
WHERE  "project_short_name" = 'TCGA-BLCA'
  AND  "Hugo_Symbol" ILIKE '%CDKN2A%'
LIMIT  20;
```

```sql
-- 2. Description: list the different mutation classifications observed in CDKN2A for BLCA
SELECT DISTINCT 
       "Variant_Type",
       "Variant_Classification"
FROM   "TCGA"."TCGA_VERSIONED"."MASKED_SOMATIC_MUTATION_HG38_GDC_R39"
WHERE  "project_short_name" = 'TCGA-BLCA'
  AND  "Hugo_Symbol" ILIKE '%CDKN2A%'
LIMIT  20;
```

```sql
-- 3. Description: retrieve case & sample barcodes plus mutation type for BLCA patients mutated in CDKN2A
SELECT  
       "case_barcode",
       "sample_barcode_tumor",
       "Variant_Type",
       "Variant_Classification"
FROM   "TCGA"."TCGA_VERSIONED"."MASKED_SOMATIC_MUTATION_HG38_GDC_R39"
WHERE  "project_short_name" = 'TCGA-BLCA'
  AND  "Hugo_Symbol" ILIKE '%CDKN2A%'
LIMIT  20;
```

```sql
-- 4. Description: preview clinical demographics table (Release 39) for BLCA patients
SELECT  
       "submitter_id"            AS "case_barcode",
       "demo__gender",
       "demo__vital_status",
       "demo__days_to_death"
FROM   "TCGA"."TCGA_VERSIONED"."CLINICAL_GDC_R39"
WHERE  "primary_site" ILIKE '%Bladder%'
LIMIT  20;
```

```sql
-- 5. Description: join CDKN2A‑mutated cases to clinical data to get gender, vital status, days to death
SELECT  m."case_barcode",
        m."Variant_Type",
        m."Variant_Classification",
        c."demo__gender",
        c."demo__vital_status",
        c."demo__days_to_death"
FROM    "TCGA"."TCGA_VERSIONED"."MASKED_SOMATIC_MUTATION_HG38_GDC_R39" m
JOIN    "TCGA"."TCGA_VERSIONED"."CLINICAL_GDC_R39"                       c
       ON m."case_barcode" = c."submitter_id"
WHERE   m."project_short_name" = 'TCGA-BLCA'
  AND   m."Hugo_Symbol" ILIKE '%CDKN2A%'
LIMIT   20;
```

```sql
-- 6. Description: expression values of MDM2 for the same BLCA cases (regardless of mutation status)
